WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:09.655
Auto Mashup turns two songs into one. Open Home, then Audio Tools, and click Make a mashup.

2
00:00:10.087 --> 00:00:17.796
Pick song A and song B from your project. Krypt checks how well they fit: tempo, key, vocal and structure.

3
00:00:19.517 --> 00:00:23.975
Choose a style, and the plan shows every section and each shift.

4
00:00:24.408 --> 00:00:31.467
Click Build. The mashup opens in a new tab as an editable project, the vocal in key with Krypt Tune.

5
00:00:31.912 --> 00:00:35.023
Only mash up songs you own or have the rights to use.
